        - Preserve tone, numbers, proper names, and natural punctuation.
        - Speaker boundaries are detected acoustically by the client. Do not emit ¶ or any speaker token.
        - Keep each translation faithful to the current client-delimited speech turn.
        - Never repeat a previously finalized subtitle in the next update.
    """.trimIndent()''',
    'PromptBuilder base instruction',
)
